  "findings": [
    "Native scene mounted/foreground are stored Bool properties; Owner/session control and optional presentation/readReopen fields are stored.",
    "presentation.id is a trivial computed getter returning identity.id; credential.isEmpty is a standard String read.",
    "All eight source facets read captured immutable HanlinSourceObservation let values, then normal value/optional equality; no new source acquisition callback.",
    "Original hanlinSource is invoked once, followed by the same whole-observation equality. Diagnostic comparisons occur only on that mismatch.",
    "No added operand invokes validation, consent consumption/revocation, navigation, persistence, RPC or an async operation.",
    "Observable getters may perform normal read tracking. This is not a claim that instrumented diagnostic file I/O or runtime timing is absent."
  ],
